{"is_source_file": true, "format": "shell script", "description": "This is a shell script that initializes and starts the parodus service by checking the existence of a command file, fetching device status and configuration information via 'dmcli' commands, forming a command line for 'parodus' with obtained parameters, and executing it. It includes logic for waiting for device components to be ready and logging actions.", "external_files": ["/tmp/parodusCmd.cmd", "/version.txt"], "external_methods": ["$GET", "cat", "ifconfig", "grep", "tr", "cut", "sleep", "echo"], "published": [], "classes": [], "methods": [], "calls": ["cat /tmp/parodusCmd.cmd", "$parodusCmd", "$GET com.cisco.spvtg.ccsp.pam.Health", "grep value", "tr -s ' '", "cut -f5 -d\" \"", "$GET Device.DeviceInfo.ModelName", "$GET Device.DeviceInfo.SerialNumber", "$GET Device.DeviceInfo.Manufacturer", "$GET Device.X_CISCO_COM_CableModem.MACAddress", "ifconfig eth0", "$GET Device.DeviceInfo.X_RDKCENTRAL-COM_LastRebootReason", "$GET Device.DeviceInfo.X_CISCO_COM_FirmwareName", "$GET Device.DeviceInfo.X_RDKCENTRAL-COM_BootTime", "cat /version.txt", "grep imagename", "cut -d ':' -f2", "$command", "echo"], "search-terms": ["parodus_start.sh", "Webpa", "parodus", "shell script", "dmcli", "device info", "start parodus"], "state": 2, "file_id": 6578, "knowledge_revision": 33236, "git_revision": "7e30f88c4ca54db6e79d70eb5e919c86fb3e3bcf", "hash": "d3d7dc5cb2ac277d70fff493c234c554", "format-version": 4, "code-base-name": "kirkstone-7931", "filename": "rdkb/components/generic/CcspLogAgent/devices/scripts/Webpa/parodus_start.sh", "revision_history": [{"33236": "7e30f88c4ca54db6e79d70eb5e919c86fb3e3bcf"}]}